Description: Creates publication-ready traffic-light plots and thirteen
    specialized visualizations for Newcastle-Ottawa Scale (NOS) risk-of-bias
    assessments in systematic reviews and meta-analyses, including domain
    radars, item-level star heatmaps, stacked star profiles, donut charts,
    lollipop charts, star matrices and the NOS visualization grid.
    Provides an R interface to the Python package 'nos-tlplot' (version
    3.0.2 or later) with four colour themes and export to 'png', 'pdf',
    'svg' and 'tiff'. Plots are produced by 'nos-tlplot' through the
    'reticulate' package.
